span.p:
Source evidence and claim-span custody
raw prompts remain evidence only;
typed facts require exact structural equality;
bounded interpretations keep hashed evidence spans

Accepted path projection custody
action/object lists stay intact;
generic user roles do not mine object tails;
state labels are not inline headings

Shared actor/action event resolver
complete accepted human actor set;
pronouns retain the current human actor;
explicit system/product events are non-human

Registry contract semantic custody
ready semantic contracts win;
profiles are fallback or supplemental proof;
source phrase surfaces and proof order preserved

Portable Atlas link custody
related_backlog paths are repo-relative;
root and symlink escapes fail before confirm

Pre-confirm quality tribunal
all package and artifact contracts pass;
no unresolved quality debt

Immutable pending package
pending / transaction hash;
transaction and receipt appear together

Compatibility tree projection
sealed write set only;
no parsing, repair, or artifact generation

Supported later CLI writer
exclusive managed-path lock;
unknown commands default to writer

Successful-writer supersession
zero exit plus changed managed readback;
failed and no-op writers keep active generation

Affected-path rollback guard
SIGINT and SIGTERM included;
failed rollback preserves recovery snapshot

Post-publication recovery state
never roll back an observed pointer;
preserve generation and journal
